================================================================
  DDoS PROTECTION — PRODUCTION DEPLOYMENT INSTRUCTIONS
  Step by step follow karo, ek bhi step mat chhodna
================================================================


================================================================
STEP 1: FOLDERS COPY KARO
================================================================

Production server pe 2 folders copy karo:

  1. DDOS/         → apne project root me (jahan app.js hai)
  2. errorLog/     → apne project root me (auto ban jayega waise bhi)
  3. scripts/      → apne project root me (nginx wale scripts)

Structure aisi honi chahiye:
  your-project/
  ├── app.js
  ├── DDOS/
  │   ├── cloudflareIPResolver.js   ← Real IP nikalata hai
  │   ├── ddosProtection.js         ← IP scoring + behavioral block
  │   ├── advancedRateLimiter.js    ← Rate limiting (200/120/10 per min)
  │   ├── connectionGuard.js        ← MongoDB/Redis overload protection
  │   ├── blockedIPLogger.js        ← Blocked IP history file banata hai
  │   ├── cloudflareBlocker.js      ← Auto push to Cloudflare
  │   ├── endpointShield.js         ← Login + Balance extra protection
  │   └── healthCheck.js            ← Admin APIs + health check
  ├── errorLog/                     ← Yahan log files ban jayengi
  ├── scripts/
  │   ├── nginx-ip-blocker.sh       ← Nginx auto block script
  │   └── nginx-ddos.conf           ← Nginx config template
  └── .env


================================================================
STEP 2: app.js ME CODE ADD KARO
================================================================

2A. Imports section me yeh add karo (routes se PEHLE):
----------------------------------------------------------

  // DDoS Protection
  const cloudflareIPResolver = require('./DDOS/cloudflareIPResolver');
  const ddosProtection = require('./DDOS/ddosProtection');
  const advancedRateLimiter = require('./DDOS/advancedRateLimiter');
  const connectionGuard = require('./DDOS/connectionGuard');
  const healthRoutes = require('./DDOS/healthCheck');
  const cloudflareBlocker = require('./DDOS/cloudflareBlocker');


2B. Middlewares add karo — app.set('trust proxy', 1) ke BAAD,
    aur helmet/cors/routes se PEHLE:
----------------------------------------------------------

  // LAYER 0: Cloudflare se real IP nikalo (sabse pehle hona chahiye)
  app.use(cloudflareIPResolver);

  // LAYER 1: DDoS Protection (IP scoring, behavioral analysis)
  app.use(ddosProtection);

  // LAYER 2: Rate Limiting (multi-tier)
  app.use(advancedRateLimiter);

  // LAYER 3: Connection Guard (DB overload protection)
  app.use(connectionGuard);

  NOTE: Yeh 4 lines helmet, cors, body-parser se PEHLE aani chahiye
  Kyunki DDoS request ko pehle hi reject karna hai — parse karne ka
  koi matlab nahi agar IP blocked hai


2C. Health check route add karo — securityGuard ke BAAD,
    API routes se PEHLE:
----------------------------------------------------------

  app.use(healthRoutes);


2D. Server start ke baad Cloudflare blocker start karo:
----------------------------------------------------------

  server.listen(PORT, (error) => {
    if (!error) {
      console.log(`Server running on port ${PORT}`);
      cloudflareBlocker.start();    // ← YEH LINE ADD KARO
    }
  });


2E. Graceful shutdown add karo (file ke end me):
----------------------------------------------------------

  process.on('SIGTERM', () => {
    cloudflareBlocker.stop();
    server.close();
  });
  process.on('SIGINT', () => {
    cloudflareBlocker.stop();
    server.close();
  });


2F. Server timeout change karo:
----------------------------------------------------------

  PEHLE (GALAT — Slowloris attack allow karta hai):
    server.timeout = 1000000;

  AB (SAHI):
    server.timeout = 30000;
    server.keepAliveTimeout = 15000;
    server.headersTimeout = 20000;


================================================================
STEP 3: ROUTE FILES ME ENDPOINT SHIELD ADD KARO
================================================================

Jis bhi route pe zyada attack aata hai wahan endpointShield add karo.

Example — User.route.js:
----------------------------------------------------------

  // TOP pe import karo
  const { loginShield, balanceShield } = require("../../DDOS/endpointShield");

  // Login route pe loginShield lagao
  router.post("/login", loginShield, UserController.Login);
  router.post("/UserLoginCheck", loginShield, UserController.UserLoginCheck);

  // Balance route pe balanceShield lagao (verifyToken ke BAAD)
  router.post("/userBalance", verifyToken, balanceShield, UserController.userBalance);

  NOTE: Path ../../DDOS/ hoga kyunki route file Routes/User/ me hai
  Agar route file root me hai toh ./DDOS/ hoga


================================================================
STEP 4: MongoDB Connection Update Karo
================================================================

Models/Connection.js ko replace karo — pooling + retry logic:
----------------------------------------------------------

  const mongoose = require("mongoose");
  let connecting = null;

  async function initialize() {
    const uri = process.env.DATABASE_URL;
    if (!uri) throw new Error("DATABASE_URL is missing");
    if (mongoose.connection.readyState === 1) return mongoose.connection;
    if (connecting) return connecting;

    mongoose.set("strictQuery", true);
    mongoose.set("autoIndex", false);
    mongoose.set("bufferCommands", true);

    const options = {
      maxPoolSize: Number(process.env.MONGO_MAX_POOL_SIZE || 30),
      minPoolSize: Number(process.env.MONGO_MIN_POOL_SIZE || 5),
      waitQueueTimeoutMS: Number(process.env.MONGO_WAIT_QUEUE_TIMEOUT_MS || 500),
      serverSelectionTimeoutMS: Number(process.env.MONGO_SERVER_SELECTION_TIMEOUT_MS || 5000),
      connectTimeoutMS: Number(process.env.MONGO_CONNECT_TIMEOUT_MS || 5000),
      socketTimeoutMS: Number(process.env.MONGO_SOCKET_TIMEOUT_MS || 20000),
      family: 4,
    };

    const maxRetries = Number(process.env.MONGO_CONNECT_RETRIES || 10);
    const baseDelay = Number(process.env.MONGO_RETRY_BASE_DELAY_MS || 500);

    mongoose.connection.on("connected", () => console.log("+ MongoDB connected +"));
    mongoose.connection.on("disconnected", () => console.warn("! MongoDB disconnected !"));
    mongoose.connection.on("error", (err) => console.error("Mongo error:", err?.message || err));

    connecting = (async () => {
      let lastErr;
      for (let attempt = 1; attempt <= maxRetries; attempt++) {
        try {
          await mongoose.connect(uri, options);
          mongoose.set("bufferCommands", false);
          return mongoose.connection;
        } catch (err) {
          lastErr = err;
          const delay = Math.min(10000, baseDelay * 2 ** (attempt - 1));
          console.error(`Mongo connect failed (${attempt}/${maxRetries}):`, err?.message || err);
          await new Promise(r => setTimeout(r, delay));
        }
      }
      throw lastErr;
    })().finally(() => { connecting = null; });

    return connecting;
  }

  module.exports = { initialize };


================================================================
STEP 5: .env ME KEYS ADD KARO
================================================================

Yeh saari keys .env file me paste karo.
Jo values diye hain woh 20k users ke hisaab se tuned hain.
Change nahi karoge toh bhi defaults se chal jayega.

----------------------------------------------------------
# ADMIN SECRET — koi bhi strong random string daalo
ADMIN_SECRET=change_this_to_any_strong_secret_123

# Cloudflare se nahi aayi request block karo (attack me true karo)
BLOCK_NON_CLOUDFLARE=false

# DDoS Protection
DDOS_ENABLED=true
DDOS_BLOCK_THRESHOLD=60
DDOS_WARN_THRESHOLD=40
DDOS_BURST_LIMIT=40
DDOS_BURST_WINDOW_MS=10000
DDOS_BLOCK_DURATION_MS=1800000
DDOS_EXTENDED_BLOCK_MS=43200000
DDOS_WHITELIST_IPS=127.0.0.1,::1

# Rate Limiting (20k users ke liye tuned)
RATE_GLOBAL_WINDOW_MS=60000
RATE_GLOBAL_MAX=200
RATE_API_WINDOW_MS=60000
RATE_API_MAX=120
RATE_SENSITIVE_WINDOW_MS=60000
RATE_SENSITIVE_MAX=10

# Endpoint Shield (login + balance protection)
LOGIN_MAX_PER_MINUTE=6
LOGIN_FAIL_MAX=5
LOGIN_BLOCK_DURATION_MS=900000
BALANCE_MAX_PER_MINUTE=30
FAILED_TOKEN_MAX=10
FAILED_TOKEN_BLOCK_MS=1800000

# Connection Guard
DB_MAX_INFLIGHT=800
CIRCUIT_BREAKER_THRESHOLD=100
CIRCUIT_BREAKER_COOLDOWN_MS=30000
REQUEST_TIMEOUT_MS=20000

# MongoDB (20k users ke liye)
MONGO_MAX_POOL_SIZE=30
MONGO_MIN_POOL_SIZE=5
MONGO_WAIT_QUEUE_TIMEOUT_MS=500
MONGO_SERVER_SELECTION_TIMEOUT_MS=5000
MONGO_CONNECT_TIMEOUT_MS=5000
MONGO_SOCKET_TIMEOUT_MS=20000
MONGO_CONNECT_RETRIES=10
MONGO_RETRY_BASE_DELAY_MS=500

# Blocked IP History
MAX_BLOCKED_IP_HISTORY=50000

# Cloudflare Auto-Blocker
CF_AUTO_BLOCK=false
CLOUDFLARE_API_TOKEN=
CLOUDFLARE_ZONE_ID=
CF_MIN_BLOCK_COUNT=2
CF_SYNC_INTERVAL_MS=30000
----------------------------------------------------------


================================================================
STEP 6: CLOUDFLARE SETUP (CF_AUTO_BLOCK enable karne ke liye)
================================================================

Yeh step tab karo jab auto-block chahiye.
Nahi chahiye toh CF_AUTO_BLOCK=false rakhne do.

6A. CLOUDFLARE_ZONE_ID lao:
  1. https://dash.cloudflare.com pe login karo
  2. Apna DOMAIN click karo
  3. Overview page → Right side → "Zone ID" copy karo

6B. CLOUDFLARE_API_TOKEN banao:
  1. https://dash.cloudflare.com/profile/api-tokens
  2. Create Token → Custom token → Get started
  3. Token name: "DDoS Auto Blocker"
  4. Permissions:
     → Zone | Firewall Services | Edit
     → Zone | Zone | Read
  5. Zone Resources:
     → Include → Specific zone → APNA DOMAIN select karo
  6. Create Token → Copy karo

6C. .env me paste karo:
  CF_AUTO_BLOCK=true
  CLOUDFLARE_API_TOKEN=jo_token_mila_woh
  CLOUDFLARE_ZONE_ID=jo_zone_id_mila_woh


================================================================
STEP 7: NGINX SETUP (optional — agar nginx use karte ho)
================================================================

7A. Nginx config copy karo:
  sudo cp scripts/nginx-ddos.conf /etc/nginx/conf.d/ddos-protection.conf
  (File me comments padho, uncomment karo apne hisaab se)

7B. Blocked IPs file banao (empty):
  sudo touch /etc/nginx/conf.d/blocked-ips.conf

7C. Nginx blocker script setup:
  chmod +x scripts/nginx-ip-blocker.sh

7D. Crontab me add karo (har minute sync):
  crontab -e
  * * * * * /path/to/project/scripts/nginx-ip-blocker.sh sync
  * * * * * sleep 30 && /path/to/project/scripts/nginx-ip-blocker.sh sync

7E. Test karo:
  sudo nginx -t && sudo nginx -s reload


================================================================
STEP 8: DEPLOY & VERIFY
================================================================

8A. Server restart karo:
  pm2 restart all

8B. Health check karo:
  curl http://localhost:5001/health

8C. DDoS stats dekho:
  curl http://localhost:5001/admin/ddos-stats?secret=APNA_SECRET

8D. Blocked IP history:
  curl http://localhost:5001/admin/blocked-ip-history?secret=APNA_SECRET

8E. Cloudflare blocker status:
  curl http://localhost:5001/admin/cloudflare-blocker/status?secret=APNA_SECRET


================================================================
ATTACK KE TIME KYA KARO (Emergency)
================================================================

.env me yeh values change karo aur pm2 restart all:

  BLOCK_NON_CLOUDFLARE=true        ← Cloudflare bypass block
  DDOS_BLOCK_THRESHOLD=40          ← Strict blocking
  DDOS_BURST_LIMIT=25              ← Burst kam karo
  RATE_GLOBAL_MAX=120              ← Rate kam karo
  RATE_API_MAX=60
  RATE_SENSITIVE_MAX=5
  LOGIN_MAX_PER_MINUTE=3
  BALANCE_MAX_PER_MINUTE=15
  DB_MAX_INFLIGHT=400
  CF_MIN_BLOCK_COUNT=1             ← Pehli baar me Cloudflare block


================================================================
FILES JO AUTO BANEGI errorLog/ FOLDER ME
================================================================

  errorLog/
  ├── blocked-ips-history.json     ← Poori history (IP, country, reason, time)
  ├── blocked-ips-list.txt         ← Plain IP list (Cloudflare import ke liye)
  ├── blocked-ips.json             ← Currently blocked IPs
  ├── cloudflare-block-rules.txt   ← Cloudflare WAF rules (copy-paste)
  ├── cloudflare-synced-ips.json   ← Cloudflare me push hui IPs
  └── nginx-blocked-ips.conf       ← Nginx deny rules


================================================================
ADMIN API ENDPOINTS
================================================================

  GET  /health                                        ← No auth
  GET  /admin/ddos-stats?secret=X                     ← DDoS + endpoint stats
  GET  /admin/blocked-ips?secret=X                    ← Currently blocked
  GET  /admin/blocked-ip-history?secret=X             ← Full history + stats
  GET  /admin/blocked-ip-history/download?secret=X    ← Download JSON
  GET  /admin/blocked-ip-list?secret=X                ← Download plain IP list
  GET  /admin/cloudflare-rules?secret=X               ← Download CF WAF rules
  GET  /admin/cloudflare-blocker/status?secret=X      ← CF blocker status
  GET  /admin/cloudflare-blocker/synced-ips?secret=X  ← CF me push hui IPs
  POST /admin/block-ip         {ip, duration}         ← Manual block
  POST /admin/unblock-ip       {ip}                   ← Manual unblock
  POST /admin/cloudflare-blocker/block   {ip, note}   ← Push to Cloudflare
  POST /admin/cloudflare-blocker/unblock {ip}         ← Remove from Cloudflare
  POST /admin/cloudflare-blocker/sync-now             ← Force sync now


================================================================
MIDDLEWARE ORDER (app.js me yeh sequence hona chahiye)
================================================================

  1. cloudflareIPResolver    ← Real IP nikalo
  2. ddosProtection          ← Behavioral analysis, IP scoring
  3. advancedRateLimiter     ← Rate limiting
  4. connectionGuard         ← DB/Redis protection
  5. helmet, hpp, xss, cors  ← Standard security
  6. body-parser             ← JSON parse
  7. securityGuard           ← SQL injection, XSS patterns
  8. healthRoutes            ← Admin APIs
  9. API routes              ← Business logic
  10. Error handlers         ← 404, 500

  loginShield / balanceShield individual routes pe lagte hain,
  global middleware nahi hain.


